# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data files are not distributed in this repository. The pipeline writes into
# data/raw_data/ and data/processed_data/; both stay empty here except for a
# placeholder, so that a clean clone has the directory structure the scripts
# expect. See README.md, "Data availability".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw_data/*
data/processed_data/*
!data/raw_data/.gitkeep
!data/processed_data/.gitkeep

# output/ holds the final tables and figures. Its file types (.csv, .png,
# .pdf, .html, .tex) are excluded everywhere else in this file, so it needs an
# explicit carve-out at the end.
!output/.gitkeep

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
env/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# R
.RData
.RDataTmp
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.Rproj.user/
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj
*-Ex.R
*.tar.gz
*.Rcheck/
.httr-oauth
*_cache/
/cache/
*.utf8.md
*.knit.md
.Renviron
rsconnect/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Large file types
*.gdb/
*.zip
*.gpkg
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.prj
*.cpg
*.sbn
*.sbx
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls

# Keep these specific files (override the patterns above)
!README.md
# Stage 01's municipality-name -> IBGE-code lookup, a small input the stage
# cannot run without (see 01_download_susceptibility_maps/making_suscep_national.md).
!01_download_susceptibility_maps/suc_codemun.xlsx

# Must come after the exclusion patterns above to override them.
!output/**

# pkgdown site
docs/

# translation temp files
po/*~
